EzADB includes the Kadb ADB client library.

Upstream: https://github.com/flyfishxu/Kadb
Version: 2.1.5 (tag 2.1.5, commit 3d1c13e8df261cc4a2bb57b03aa8c392cb8386c3)
License: Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE)

The upstream commonMain and androidMain Kotlin sources are vendored under src/main/kotlin.
For EzADB's single-target Android build, the Kotlin Multiplatform expect/actual declarations
were merged into plain Android Kotlin sources (expect declarations removed, actual modifiers
stripped). No protocol logic was intentionally changed.

The Gradle build file was adapted for EzADB's Android toolchain.

Kadb acknowledges Dadb, libadb-android and spake2-java.
